-- title:
--   RH height 14–100 — theta coefficient data, part B
-- statement:
--   Rounded integer Taylor coefficients and error radii for the theta exponential jets in the height-14–100 certificate. This part contains 25 active panel/theta-term records, ordered as [(2, 6), (2, 7), (3, 0), (3, 1), (3, 2), (3, 3), (3, 4), (3, 5), (3, 6), (3, 7), (4, 0), (4, 1), (4, 2), (4, 3), (4, 4), (4, 5), (5, 0), (5, 1), (5, 2), (5, 3), (5, 4), (6, 0), (6, 1), (6, 2), (6, 3)]. Each record has 184 centers and 184 radii at decimal scale 10^310. These are proposed finite data, not assumed bounds: the main height-block proof checks every enclosure, recurrence residual, rounding condition and carry bound. The theta/Mellin foundations retain attribution to Gabewhigham; the finite-certificate construction is from sometik179’s October 3, 2026 proof source.
--
--   **Port note.** This is a port, to the Mathlib `777aaa6` / Lean v4.29.0-rc3 environment of the Riemann Hypothesis mission tree, of the definition `TaoFivePrimes_RH14To100ThetaDataB` (id `3074bf1b-9af5-4ba9-b377-4eb45d35edd3`, env `0df444a`, published by @raresbuhai). Changes: the single literal list is split into one named definition per entry (Lean v4.29.0-rc3 overflows its stack elaborating the original 8000-element literal); the resulting list value is identical.
-- source:
--   sometik179, height-14–100 Lean certificate proof, Prove2Me submission c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a (2026-10-03), https://prove2.me/submissions/c9908072-d99a-4431-aad8-a72c6352619a. Theta/Mellin foundations attributed there to Gabewhigham, accepted submission 7ab19408-190a-439f-81f8-63e983ebb00b. Ordinary-syntax literal data preserved from the recovered export.; ported from 0df444a definition 3074bf1b-9af5-4ba9-b377-4eb45d35edd3

